    "text": "Today A mix of clouds and sun. High 75F. Winds SW at 10 to 20 mph. Tonight Cloudy skies with periods of rain late. Low 57F. Winds WSW at 10 to 15 mph. Chance of rain 80%. Rainfall near a quarter of an inch. Tomorrow Rain ending early. Remaining cloudy. Much colder. Morning high of 61F with temps falling to near 45. Winds N at 10 to 15 mph. Chance of rain 90%. Tomorrow Night Cloudy skies early, followed by partial clearing. Low 33F. Winds NNW at 10 to 15 mph. Saturday Sunny. High near 45F. Winds NNW at 10 to 20 mph. Saturday Night Mostly clear. Low near 30F. Winds light and variable. Sunday Partly cloudy. High 56F. Winds SSW at 10 to 15 mph. Sunday Night A few clouds from time to time. Low 43F. Winds SSW at 5 to 10 mph. Monday Intervals of clouds and sunshine in the morning with more clouds for later in the day. Slight chance of a rain shower. High 65F. Winds SW at 5 to 10 mph. Monday Night Mostly cloudy skies with a few showers late. Low 52F. Winds SW at 5 to 10 mph. Chance of rain 30%. Tuesday Mostly cloudy skies early, then partly cloudy in the afternoon. High 68F. Winds SSW at 10 to 15 mph. Tuesday Night Partly to mostly cloudy. Low 59F. Winds S at 5 to 10 mph. Wednesday Partly cloudy early. Scattered thunderstorms developing in the afternoon. High 77F. Winds SSW at 10 to 15 mph. Chance of rain 40%. Wednesday Night A few showers early with mostly cloudy conditions late. Low 56F. Winds SSW at 5 to 10 mph. Chance of rain 40%. Thursday Sunshine and clouds mixed. High 77F. Winds SSW at 10 to 15 mph. Thursday Night Overcast with showers at times. Low 54F. Winds S at 5 to 10 mph. Chance of rain 40%. Friday Cloudy with showers. High 64F. Winds S at 10 to 15 mph. Chance of rain 50%. Friday Night Showers in the evening with some clearing overnight. Low 47F. Winds ENE at 5 to 10 mph. Chance of rain 50%. Saturday More clouds than sun. High 59F. Winds E at 5 to 10 mph. Saturday Night Considerable cloudiness. Low 49F. Winds E at 5 to 10 mph.",
